<div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0a2463] to-[#1e40af] px-4 text-white">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl">
    <div class="w-48 h-48 mx-auto mb-8 shadow-2xl rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/20">
      <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="HoySiCoronamos S.A. Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover bg-white" />
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 tracking-tight">
      Bienvenido a: <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-success to-info">HoySiCoronamos S.A.</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-10 text-white/80 font-light leading-relaxed">
      La plataforma de lotería más confiable. Juega, gana y haz tus sueños realidad con nuestros sorteos exclusivos.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-success btn-lg w-full sm:w-auto px-10 shadow-lg shadow-success/30 border-none rounded-full text-lg">
        Iniciar Sesión
      </a>
      <a href="/registro" class="btn btn-outline border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0a2463] btn-lg w-full sm:w-auto px-10 rounded-full text-lg">
        Crear Cuenta
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
